","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#pullrequestreview-3327482401","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105450","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-11T17:13:32Z"},{"id":3342726473,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7HPfVJ","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"6faa4e369a9833741844f6faabf67ca3ffc63a2f","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Code looks good to me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#pullrequestreview-3342726473","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105450","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-16T00:42:19Z"},{"id":3344805413,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7HXa4l","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"6faa4e369a9833741844f6faabf67ca3ffc63a2f","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"I'm not sure we want to make decisions about whether a class is virtual or not solely based on whether we need to auto infer its property defaults.  Making them not virtual means we allow extensions and scripts to create them on demand.\r\nIf that is expected and supported, I'm fine with this change.\r\nIf it's not, we should be looking into other ways to get property default values. The 'default property' gathering script has certainly caused a lot of issues lately anyway.\r\n\r\nI don't know much about how these classes are used, so I can't make this call. If someone could clear this up, I'd feel comfortable to go ahead with this.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#pullrequestreview-3344805413","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105450","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-16T13:17:31Z"},{"id":3346513798,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Hd7-G","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"6faa4e369a9833741844f6faabf67ca3ffc63a2f","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"Then it's fine, I guess. If there's no reason to avoid creating them, there's no need for us to restrict it.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105450#pullrequestreview-3346513798","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105450","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-16T18:52:38Z"},{"id":3356688069,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7IEv7F","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"6faa4e369a9833741844f6faabf67ca3ffc63a2f","user":{"s